AutoFLUSH "Space" util V1.12ß by Zwinx/RAGE
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
This neat little util is written to be used with /X 2.xx and 3.xx. It's easy
to use and install.

FEATURES
~~~~~~~~
× This util makes sure that there's ALWAYS some bytes free for uploading!

INSTALLATION NOTICE
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
IF YOU USE /X VERSION 2.x THEN YOU CAN'T USE THE SUPPLIED SCRIPTFILE TO
INSTALL/UPDATE THIS DOOR!

/X 2.x INSTALLATION
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
× Make a directory called "Space" in DOORS:

ex.
HD:> makedir DOORS:Space

× Unpack the Space.LHA archive in DOORS:Space.

ex.
HD:> cd DOCS:Space
HD:BBS/DOORS/TOPchat> lha x RAM:Space.lha

× Move, rename or copy the "SPACE" command to C:

× Insert the following line in your SYS.CMD file. Read /X documentation for
  further information.

---CUT---
SPACE     RM010DOORS:Space/Space.rexx
---CUT---

× Edit BBS:<conf>/UploadMsg.txt, where <conf> is the name of the conference
  that you would like to flush files from.

ex.
---CUT---
~
~CC_SPACE

Uploading is fun! Najs....
---CUT---

/X 3.x INSTALLATION
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
× Unpack the Space.LHA archive to RAM:
 
ex.
HD:> cd RAM:
Ram Disk:> lha x RAM:Space.lha

× Execute the AE3.x_Install-script.

ex.
Ram Disk:> AE3.x_Install

CONFIGURATION
~~~~~~~~~~~~~
× Edit DOORS:Space/Space.cfg like this:

ex.
---CUT---
BBS:ELITE/DIR2
BBS:ELITE/DIR1
4000000
7000000
dh2:
dh3:
dh4:
---CUT---

Line1: Filename (and correct path!) to the fillisting file that you want to
       flush files from.
Line2: Filename (and correct path!) to the filelist were you want to put the
       deleted files wich will be marked "OFFLINE" instead of the fillength.
Line3: Minimum free space on disk. The AutoFLUSH command will NEVER delete
       anything if there is MORE system bytes free than this.
Line4: Minimum free space after delete session. When the AutoFLUSH util is
       trigged it will continue to delete files until there's AT LEAST this
       amount of free space.
Line5: This can be MULTIPLE LINES! This is the path(s) to ALL DEVICES (NOT
       ALL UPLOAD-DIRECTORYS) that are used for uploading.

× Put all upload dirs in DOORS:Space/Space.dirs.

ex.
---CUT---
BBS:ELITE/Upload/
dh3:Upload/
dh4:Upload/
---CUT---

IMPORTANT!
~~~~~~~~~~
× T: MUST be assigned!
× "SPACE" must be in C:

IMPROVEMENT
~~~~~~~~~~~
×V1.01ß Now puts the destination files in another dir. (released)
×V1.12ß Icons for /X 3.x added. Installscript3.x added to archive.

